{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Infinite Hotel, a physical afterlife that worships ancient artists from the 20th-22nd century, has been awarded greatest expression due to its creator's suicide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As cosmic artists converge to destroy it, you play as Violet, a witch looking for her brother at the edge of the world, not knowing her entire planet is on top of a hotel building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique RPG epic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giant interconnected areas to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of learnable skills from 10 weapon types and 21 elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of different monsters to peacefully kill with violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a thousand weapons and armor that anyone can equip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive talent tree to further customize your town and team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic combat psychology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghost Ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Game+.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No max level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And of course, you unironically saying murda for the rest of your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally released in the summer of 2016, Wooden Ocean has received consistent updates for the last 9 years, more than tripling its original size and story. These updates will continue long after it's tripled again.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/684000?t=1773200884","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/684000/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773200884","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/684000/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773200884","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/684000/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773200884","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"\r\nlanguage\r\n\r\ntopics"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Infinite Hotel, a physical afterlife that worships ancient artists from the 20th-22nd century, has been awarded greatest expression due to its creator's suicide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As cosmic artists converge to destroy it, you play as Violet, a witch looking for her brother at the edge of the world, not knowing her entire planet is on top of a hotel building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique RPG epic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giant interconnected areas to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of learnable skills from 10 weapon types and 21 elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of different monsters to peacefully kill with violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a thousand weapons and armor that anyone can equip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive talent tree to further customize your town and team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic combat psychology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghost Ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Game+.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No max level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And of course, you unironically saying murda for the rest of your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally released in the summer of 2016, Wooden Ocean has received consistent updates for the last 9 years, more than tripling its original size and story. These updates will continue long after it's tripled again.</p>","developers":["Leif Ian Anderson"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/684000/header.jpg?t=1773200884","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/684000/284233/684bd938d5a135985353cedbb59f09729c3331e1/1751130833/dash_av1.mpd?t=1591817188","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/684000/284233/684bd938d5a135985353cedbb59f09729c3331e1/1751130833/dash_h264.mpd?t=1591817188","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/684000/284233/684bd938d5a135985353cedbb59f09729c3331e1/1751130833/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1591817188","id":256784701,"name":"Wooden Ocean Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256784701/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1591817188"}],"name":"Wooden Ocean","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Wooden Ocean - $19.99 USD","packageid":195574,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":1999}],"title":"Buy Wooden Ocean"}],"packages":[195574],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or Greater<br></l